================================================================================
  THE COMPLETE MERGED METAGRAPH PROFILE
================================================================================

  Quantities known EXACTLY for all n (via Burnside):
    V_n = A000568(n)
    SC_n = anti-aut Burnside count
    V_merged = (V_n + SC_n) / 2
    T_n = Burnside transition orbits
    T_anti = anti-aut transition orbits
    T_merged = (T_n + T_anti) / 2

  Quantities known EXACTLY up to n=9:
    E(G_n): 1, 5, 30, 290, 4086, 91161, 3380751
    E_merged: 1, 3, 21, 143, 2123, 45550

  Structural laws verified at n=3..8:
    1. DAG: 0 H-decreasing edges (all n)
    2. trans_SC_deg = floor((n-1)/2) (all n)
    3. First SC neighbor H: alternates 3,5 for odd,even n (n≥5)
    4. SC backbone connected for n≤7, disconnects at n=8
    5. deg_max = m for n≥7
    6. chi(G_n/Z_2) = n-1 (verified n≤6, consistent n=7)
    7. T/(2E) → 1 (Burnside)
    8. E_merged/E_orig → 1/2 (twin fraction → 1/2)
    9. Blue fraction → 1 (SC fraction → 0)
    10. Collapsed edges only at even n

  Open questions:
    - Exact formula for E(G_n) or E_merged
    - Width formula (fails at n≥7)
    - Diameter formula (fails at n≥7)
    - Spectral gap behavior for large n
    - Betti number growth rate

